# NOTICE — Third-party attribution

This repository contains the late-fusion result artefact (mixing constant alpha,
metrics report JSON) of the **HuBERT + RuBERT** Russian emotion classification
pipeline. No separate trained weights are distributed here; the fusion combines
the outputs of two external models.

## Pretrained models involved

| Component | Source | License | Relation |
|---|---|---|---|
| HuBERT-large SER (Dusha-finetuned, xbgoose) | <https://huggingface.co/xbgoose/hubert-speech-emotion-recognition-russian-dusha-finetuned> | Apache-2.0 (base `facebook/hubert-large-ls960-ft`) | Audio branch; probability outputs only (its weights are NOT embedded here) |
| DeepPavlov RuBERT (`rubert-base-cased`) | <https://huggingface.co/DeepPavlov/rubert-base-cased> | Apache-2.0 | Base of the text branch (fine-tuned model published separately) |

## Training data of the branches

| Dataset | Source | License | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| Dusha (Salute Developers / Sber) | <https://github.com/salute-developers/golos/tree/master/dusha> · arXiv:2212.12266 | Dusha/Golos, attribution + share-alike (a reworked CC BY-SA 4.0) | Corpus `dusha_resd` = Dusha + RESD |
| RESD (`Aniemore/resd_annotated`) | <https://huggingface.co/datasets/Aniemore/resd_annotated> · DOI 10.57967/hf/1272 | MIT | Only the 4 target emotions are retained |

